                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A metal beam that connects a piston to a connecting rod in an engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9b6b6de-a18c-4a10-bb06-3dfc4ffacdcf",
                                                "sense_id": "db8e2c6f-7fcc-3147-8dbd-388cac783466",
                                                "text": "All the Connor characteristics are seen in this locomotive: sharply inclined cylinders let into the side framing, which was slotted to expose the crosshead; […]."
